    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BRAND NEW HUNTING EXPERIANCE</h2>Experience hunting like never before in <i>Hunting with Dad</i>! The game is a fast paced take on hunting with quick and understandable onboarding. Its the perfect first step into hunting!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAGICAL ABILITES!</h2>Hunt to gain hearts and give them to Dad! He will reward you with <strong>magical abilites</strong> that will help you along your journey.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BEAT THE BOSS!</h2>Before ending your journey you will be faced with one last challenge, the boss. Defeat him using everything you've learned and become the best hunter.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2>Explore the hand made map and make sure to keep your eye sharp, there may be some secrets.",
